WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Open the Calendar (⇧⌘C)

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.300
Next week (⌘→)

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.100
Drag it to another time

4
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.600
Moved — Undo is in the banner

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.100
Right-click the block…

6
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.600
